    cvx:activitiesPerformed "Consolidated asset condition data from eight legacy systems (CSV exports, REST APIs, GIS shapefiles) into a unified PostgreSQL data warehouse. Built a dbt transformation layer producing 40 standardised KPI views. Developed geospatial analytics identifying 14 high-risk asset clusters." ;
    cvx:benefitsDelivered "Platform delivered in 11 weeks, 8 weeks ahead of original plan. Geospatial analysis directly informed a £3.2m capital investment decision. KPI views used by asset managers and the Cabinet Member for Transport." ;
    cvx:clientName "Gondor Municipal Authority" ;
    cvx:domain "public-sector" ;
    cvx:endDate "2020-02-28"^^xsd:date ;
