:proj_rivendell_fhir a cvx:Project ;
    cvx:activitiesPerformed "Completed a current-state assessment covering 38 system integrations and 120 daily message flows. Designed target-state FHIR R4 resource model and migration sequencing plan. Delivered proof-of-concept ingesting patient ADT feeds into FHIR at 99.97% fidelity. | Conducted current-state assessment of 38 system integrations and 120 daily message flows. Produced target-state FHIR R4 resource model and migration sequencing plan. Built a proof-of-concept ingesting ADT feeds at 99.97% fidelity." ;
    cvx:benefitsDelivered "Proof-of-concept achieved 99.97% fidelity for patient ADT feed ingestion into FHIR. Clear migration sequencing plan produced for 38 integrations. | Proof-of-concept demonstrated 99.97% fidelity for ADT feed ingestion, validating the target architecture for full programme roll-out." ;
    cvx:clientName "Rivendell Health Systems" ;
    cvx:domain "healthcare" ;
    cvx:projectDescription "Ongoing engagement to redesign the data integration architecture for a regional NHS trust, scoping a migration from a custom HL7 v2 integration engine to a FHIR-native platform using Azure Health Data Services. | Redesigning a regional NHS trust's integration architecture from a custom HL7 v2 engine to a FHIR-native platform on Azure Health Data Services." ;
    cvx:projectName "Rivendell Health Systems — Clinical Data Pipeline Modernisation | Clinical Data Pipeline Modernisation" ;
    cvx:roleTitle "Lead Data Architect" ;
    cvx:startDate "2025-02-01"^^xsd:date ;
    cvx:usesSkill :skill_azure,
        :skill_data_modelling,
        :skill_fhir,
        :skill_hl7,
        :skill_python .

